.TH "LINTO-INDEX" 1

.SH "Linto guide"
.PP
Linto is a local command\-line toolbox for bibliography work, Quarto projects,
text processing, and development helpers\. This guide is split into topic pages:
.RS
.IP \(bu 4
Installation and shell setup
.IP \(bu 4
Group configuration
.IP \(bu 4
Commands and invocation
.IP \(bu 4
BibTeX and bibliography workflow
.IP \(bu 4
Quarto workflow
.IP \(bu 4
Shell completion
.RE
.PP
Use \fBlinto help PAGE\fP to read a page in the terminal, for example \fBlinto help
config\fP\. If a page name is also an active group name, select it explicitly with
\fBlinto help page PAGE\fP (for example, \fBlinto help page bibtex\fP)\. \fBlinto help
GROUP\fP lists the commands in a group, and \fBlinto help GROUP COMMAND\fP shows a
command's help\.
.PP
For a live list of active groups and commands, run \fBlinto \-\-help\fP\.
